            <note corresp="#d158-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d158-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Files, 851K.49/10-1161. Confidential; Niact.
                    Drafted by Heavner, cleared with
                        Wood, ICA, DOD, and the Bureau of the
                    Budget, initialed for the Acting Secretary by Cottrell, and repeated to CINCPAC for PolAd, Phnom Penh, and Bangkok for Anspacher.</p>
